/**
 * Popular second-hand cars in Australia, so a used buyer can skip the AI lookup.
 * Every model year from 2014 to 2025 that CarsGuide prices, for each model (Nov 2026).
 * - One variant per fuel type and year: the cheapest automatic petrol, and the cheapest full hybrid
 *   where the model had one (EV and PHEV models: their cheapest variant). Manuals, diesels, utes,
 *   mild hybrids and Queensland-only listings are left out.
 * - purchasePrice: the middle of the CarsGuide used guide range for that variant and year
 *   (Glass's Information Services data). Years CarsGuide shows as "No recent listings" are left out.
 * - petrolConsumption / electricConsumption: official combined figures per model generation, from
 *   model knowledge, rounded. Not re-checked per year.
 * - CO2 and tare are left out: used duty doesn't depend on CO2, and rego falls back to the
 *   estimate from fuel use. Servicing falls back to the app's typical value.
 * Used prices drift down: refresh quarterly with the new-car catalogue and bump USED_CATALOGUE_AS_OF.
 */
